WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.050
Hello, everyone. Here I am at my new job!

2
00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:19.950
Yesterday at my first day of work … Well, let’s not talk about yesterday.

3
00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:21.990
Today is a new day!

4
00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:25.250
Today I want to apologize to my co-workers.

5
00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:31.770
Hi, Anne. Are you busy?

6
00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:36.450
Hi, Anna. Yes. At 10 a.m. I am writing.

7
00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:39.770
Every day I do my morning show.

8
00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:41.130
Sorry!

9
00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:45.610
Okay. See you later, maybe.

10
00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:48.190
Maybe I’ll see you later.

11
00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:05.490
Hi, Jonathan. Are you busy?

12
00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:07.130
Yes, I’m busy.

13
00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:11.730
When the studio light is on, I am recording my evening show.

14
00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:14.070
Right. Sorry about yesterday.

15
00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:15.290
No worries.

16
00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:16.890
May I see the studio?

17
00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:18.270
Um, maybe another time?

18
00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:20.310
Right now I am busy.

19
00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:23.670
Sure. Okay, ’bye.

20
00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:24.430
‘Bye.

21
00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:59.390
Hi, Amelia! Are you busy?

22
00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:00.790
I’m a little busy.

23
00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:05.290
I want to say I’m sorry for yesterday.

24
00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:06.790
It’s okay, Anna.

25
00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:08.450
Well, I am sorry.

26
00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:11.270
It’s okay, Anna. Come by this afternoon.

27
00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:12.490
Okay.
